  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(45 + 9) ÷ 2 - 7 × 33 ÷ 7 + {(7 + 18) × 6} + 9 × 8 - 89\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS/BIDMAS (Brackets, Orders (i.e. powers and square roots, etc.), Division and Multiplication, Addition and Subtraction)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(45 + 9) ÷ 2 - 7 × 33 ÷ 7 + {(7 + 18) × 6} + 9 × 8 - 89\n\n⇒ 54 ÷ 2 - 7 × 33 ÷ 7 + {25 × 6} + 9 × 8 - 89\n\n⇒ 27 - 7 × 33 ÷ 7 + 150 + 72 - 89\n\n⇒ 27 - 231 ÷ 7 + 150 + 72 - 89\n\n⇒ 27 - 33 + 150 + 72 - 89\n\n⇒ 27 - 33 + 150 + 72 - 89\n\n⇒ -6 + 150 + 72 - 89\n\n⇒ 144 + 72 - 89\n\n⇒ 216 - 89\n\n⇒ 127\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
